{"change_summary":"Fixed the remaining plant-growth helper-layer bug by recomputing TAN, nitrate, and phosphate concentrations inside each plant-guild iteration in `step_daily_plants`, so later guilds now evaluate nutrient limitation and health against the post-uptake water column instead of stale pre-loop chemistry. Added a regression test that seeds two identical water-column-feeding plant guilds, verifies the earlier guild depletes shared nutrients first, and asserts the later guild ends the day with lower biomass and health under the updated chemistry.","outstanding_risks":["Legacy process field names such as `plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total`, `aob_k_tan_mg`, and `decomposer_k_doc_mg` still read like total-mass parameters even though runtime semantics now normalize them onto concentration- or area-based units; that rename work remains deferred to downstream normalization beads.","`TankState` convenience helpers still each recompute `self.concentrations()` when called individually in sequence, so non-hot-path callers can still pay repeated net-water-volume lookups unless they reuse `ConcentrationView` explicitly.","Schema-2 save migration still assumes legacy dissolved totals were authored against gross water volume, so a hand-edited or previously pre-migrated schema-2 file could still be rescaled again on load."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current `plant_growth` loop and confirmed that water-column concentrations were captured once before guild iteration even though each guild mutates shared dissolved nutrient pools via `remove_plant_nutrients()`.", "order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs` so each guild iteration refreshes TAN, nitrate, and phosphate from `TankState::concentrations()` before computing water-column limitation factors, while keeping the unchanged DIC factor outside the loop.", "order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added a regression in `crates/tank_core/tests/plant_algae_integration.rs` that exercises two identical water-column-feeding guilds and verifies later guilds now see depleted chemistry through lower realized biomass and health.", "order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting plus targeted and full validation to confirm the fix and regression hold across the workspace.", "order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -q -p tank_core --test plant_algae_integration` completed successfully with 8 passing tests, including the new `later_plant_guilds_see_updated_water_column_chemistry` regression.","`cargo test --quiet` completed successfully across the workspace.","`cargo clippy --all-targets --quiet` completed successfully."]}